{"content_hash": "d800978056a7fe2d", "version_id": 805, "article_id": 81, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "Farming Simulator 25 adds Brazilian coffee and alpacas in new DLC", "title_zh": "《模拟农场25》新DLC上线，去巴西种咖啡养羊驼", "has_translation": true, "topic": "culture", "source": "gcores", "source_url": "https://www.gcores.com/articles/221607", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612287230202-1ff1d85d1bdf?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MXx8ZGxjJTIwdmlkZW8lMjBnYW1lJTIwY29udHJvbGxlcnxlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzkzMjM2MjEzfDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Javier Martínez on Unsplash", "author": "Javier Martínez", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@cjdante?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/game-controller-in-neon-light-hUD0PUczwJQ?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(176, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(214, 46%, 48%)", "label": "CULTURE", "seed": "5ab094f0a0ba"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-29", "word_count": 270, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Sega has released Beans & Alpacas, a paid expansion for Farming Simulator 25 that transports players to a South American valley modelled on Brazil's coffee-growing heartland, complete with two new crops and a herd of unconventional livestock.", "lead_zh": "世嘉为《模拟农场25》推出付费扩展包“Beans & Alpacas”，把玩家带到以巴西咖啡产区为原型的南美山谷，新增两种作物和一批别具一格的牲畜。", "preview": "The expansion, available now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC via Steam, Epic Games Store and Windows, and Mac, introduces Catuaí, a hu", "preview_zh": "该扩展包现已登陆 PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC（Steam、Epic Games Store 与 Windows）及 Mac 平台，新增区域“卡杜艾”——一片红土、植被茂密、丘陵平缓的湿润绿谷。狭窄的道路、尘土飞扬的街道、零星散布的岩石与蜿蜒的", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 788, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 107.375, "size_bytes": 645264, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 323, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 111.5, "size_bytes": 669888, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 323, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 116.85, "size_bytes": 702000, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 323, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 100.95, "size_bytes": 606672, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 323, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/81/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 107.55, "size_bytes": 646272, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 323, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/81/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@5e0dbb9/content/data/versions/805.json", "paragraphs": ["The expansion, available now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC via Steam, Epic Games Store and Windows, and Mac, introduces Catuaí, a humid green valley of red soil, dense vegetation and gently rolling hills. Narrow roads, dusty streets, scattered rocks and a winding river lend the region its distinctive character, while players can also explore a local museum's dinosaur skeleton or a research facility hidden deep in the forest.", "Two crops join the roster: coffee, which can be dried and roasted on site, and bananas, handled with transport rails and washing equipment. Harvests can be processed into tiramisu, banana chips and other goods. Alpacas, meanwhile, reward owners who take them for walks with higher happiness and can be shorn once a year; the fleece sells directly or becomes yarn, socks, pillows, furniture and plush toys. Brahman cattle also arrive, alongside parrots and harmless caimans.", "More than 25 new machines and implements appear, drawn from Case IH, Ford, John Deere, KUHN, Mercedes-Benz Trucks, New Holland, Oxbo, Stara and Valtra, with Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders joining the series for the first time. Beans & Alpacas is sold standalone or as part of the Year 2 Season Pass, which offers better value than buying each piece of content separately.", "A bundled Farming Simulator 25: Beans & Alpacas Edition also launches alongside it. Across four environments inspired by North America, Central Europe, East Asia and South America, players can deploy over 400 machines and tools from more than 150 real brands. The base game, which added Asian rice cultivation, now spans 25 crops and supports online play for up to six people."], "paragraphs_zh": ["该扩展包现已登陆 PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC（Steam、Epic Games Store 与 Windows）及 Mac 平台，新增区域“卡杜艾”——一片红土、植被茂密、丘陵平缓的湿润绿谷。狭窄的道路、尘土飞扬的街道、零星散布的岩石与蜿蜒的河流共同塑造了当地风貌；玩家还可探访收藏恐龙骨架的当地博物馆，或深入森林中的研究设施。", "两种作物加入种植名单：咖啡可现场干燥与烘焙，香蕉则借助运输滑轨和清洗设备处理。收获物还能加工成提拉米苏、香蕉片等产品。羊驼方面，带它们散步可提升幸福度，每年还能剪一次毛；羊驼毛可直接出售，也可制成毛线、袜子、枕头、家具和毛绒玩偶。婆罗门牛同样登场，鹦鹉和不会咬人的凯门鳄也一并出现。", "超过25种新农机与农具亮相，来自 Case IH、Ford、John Deere、KUHN、Mercedes-Benz Trucks、New Holland、Oxbo、Stara 和 Valtra 等品牌，其中 Colombo Industries 与 Southern Spreaders 首次入驻本系列。“Beans & Alpacas”既可单独购买，也收录于“Year 2 Season Pass”季票中，买季票比逐项购买更划算。", "《模拟农场25：Beans & Alpacas Edition》捆绑版同步发售。在以北美、中欧、东亚和南美为灵感的四种环境中，玩家可动用来自150多个真实品牌的400多种农机农具。正篇此前已加入亚洲稻米栽培，如今作物增至25种，并支持最多6人在线游玩。"], "body": "The expansion, available now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC via Steam, Epic Games Store and Windows, and Mac, introduces Catuaí, a humid green valley of red soil, dense vegetation and gently rolling hills. Narrow roads, dusty streets, scattered rocks and a winding river lend the region its distinctive character, while players can also explore a local museum's dinosaur skeleton or a research facility hidden deep in the forest.\n\nTwo crops join the roster: coffee, which can be dried and roasted on site, and bananas, handled with transport rails and washing equipment. Harvests can be processed into tiramisu, banana chips and other goods. Alpacas, meanwhile, reward owners who take them for walks with higher happiness and can be shorn once a year; the fleece sells directly or becomes yarn, socks, pillows, furniture and plush toys. Brahman cattle also arrive, alongside parrots and harmless caimans.\n\nMore than 25 new machines and implements appear, drawn from Case IH, Ford, John Deere, KUHN, Mercedes-Benz Trucks, New Holland, Oxbo, Stara and Valtra, with Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders joining the series for the first time. Beans & Alpacas is sold standalone or as part of the Year 2 Season Pass, which offers better value than buying each piece of content separately.\n\nA bundled Farming Simulator 25: Beans & Alpacas Edition also launches alongside it. Across four environments inspired by North America, Central Europe, East Asia and South America, players can deploy over 400 machines and tools from more than 150 real brands. The base game, which added Asian rice cultivation, now spans 25 crops and supports online play for up to six people.", "body_zh": "该扩展包现已登陆 PlayStation 5、Xbox Series X|S、PC（Steam、Epic Games Store 与 Windows）及 Mac 平台，新增区域“卡杜艾”——一片红土、植被茂密、丘陵平缓的湿润绿谷。狭窄的道路、尘土飞扬的街道、零星散布的岩石与蜿蜒的河流共同塑造了当地风貌；玩家还可探访收藏恐龙骨架的当地博物馆，或深入森林中的研究设施。\n\n两种作物加入种植名单：咖啡可现场干燥与烘焙，香蕉则借助运输滑轨和清洗设备处理。收获物还能加工成提拉米苏、香蕉片等产品。羊驼方面，带它们散步可提升幸福度，每年还能剪一次毛；羊驼毛可直接出售，也可制成毛线、袜子、枕头、家具和毛绒玩偶。婆罗门牛同样登场，鹦鹉和不会咬人的凯门鳄也一并出现。\n\n超过25种新农机与农具亮相，来自 Case IH、Ford、John Deere、KUHN、Mercedes-Benz Trucks、New Holland、Oxbo、Stara 和 Valtra 等品牌，其中 Colombo Industries 与 Southern Spreaders 首次入驻本系列。“Beans & Alpacas”既可单独购买，也收录于“Year 2 Season Pass”季票中，买季票比逐项购买更划算。\n\n《模拟农场25：Beans & Alpacas Edition》捆绑版同步发售。在以北美、中欧、东亚和南美为灵感的四种环境中，玩家可动用来自150多个真实品牌的400多种农机农具。正篇此前已加入亚洲稻米栽培，如今作物增至25种，并支持最多6人在线游玩。", "text": "The expansion, available now on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, PC via Steam, Epic Games Store and Windows, and Mac, introduces Catuaí, a humid green valley of red soil, dense vegetation and gently rolling hills. Narrow roads, dusty streets, scattered rocks and a winding river lend the region its distinctive character, while players can also explore a local museum's dinosaur skeleton or a research facility hidden deep in the forest. Two crops join the roster: coffee, which can be dried and roasted on site, and bananas, handled with transport rails and washing equipment. Harvests can be processed into tiramisu, banana chips and other goods. Alpacas, meanwhile, reward owners who take them for walks with higher happiness and can be shorn once a year; the fleece sells directly or becomes yarn, socks, pillows, furniture and plush toys. Brahman cattle also arrive, alongside parrots and harmless caimans. More than 25 new machines and implements appear, drawn from Case IH, Ford, John Deere, KUHN, Mercedes-Benz Trucks, New Holland, Oxbo, Stara and Valtra, with Colombo Industries and Southern Spreaders joining the series for the first time. Beans & Alpacas is sold standalone or as part of the Year 2 Season Pass, which offers better value than buying each piece of content separately. A bundled Farming Simulator 25: Beans & Alpacas Edition also launches alongside it. Across four environments inspired by North America, Central Europe, East Asia and South America, players can deploy over 400 machines and tools from more than 150 real brands. The base game, which added Asian rice cultivation, now spans 25 crops and supports online play for up to six people.", "vocab": [{"word": "expansion", "pos": "noun", "zh": "扩展包", "note": "游戏语境中指追加内容，比 DLC 更书面", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "livestock", "pos": "noun", "zh": "牲畜", "note": "不可数，统称饲养的动物", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "roster", "pos": "noun", "zh": "名单，阵容", "note": "常与 join/add to 搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shear", "pos": "verb", "zh": "剪（羊毛）", "note": "过去分词 shorn，用于羊驼、绵羊", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fleece", "pos": "noun", "zh": "羊毛，绒毛", "note": "指一次剪下的毛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "implements", "pos": "noun", "zh": "农具，器械", "note": "农业语境中常与 machinery 并列", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "standalone", "pos": "adj", "zh": "独立销售的", "note": "与捆绑版、季票相对", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "bundled", "pos": "adj", "zh": "捆绑的，套装版", "note": "bundle 的形容词形式", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "deploy", "pos": "verb", "zh": "动用，部署", "note": "正式用词，此处指使用农机", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lend ... its character", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "赋予……独特风貌", "note": "lend 可接双宾语，写作亮点搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "draw from", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "取自，来源于", "note": "说明品牌、来源", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "on site", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "在现场", "note": "此处指在农场内完成加工", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "spans", "pos": "verb", "zh": "涵盖，包括", "note": "主语为范围、内容时常用", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "better value", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "更划算", "note": "英式表达，指性价比更高", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-29T01:10:10.588590", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.25, "e": 0.375, "sm": 250, "em": 375, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "expansion", "s": 0.375, "e": 1.125, "sm": 375, "em": 1125, "cs": 4, "ce": 13, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": ",", "s": 1.125, "e": 1.225, "sm": 1125, "em": 1225, "cs": 13, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "available", "s": 1.225, "e": 1.7, "sm": 1225, "em": 1699, "cs": 15, "ce": 24, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "now", "s": 1.7, "e": 1.887, "sm": 1700, "em": 1887, "cs": 25, "ce": 28, "si": 